      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The documented insertion modes are Shell Syntax, Extended JSON, and Field-by-Field. Field-by-Field accepts one document at a time; the text modes accept arrays. Compass generates an ObjectId when _id is omitted. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
