    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The Documents tab supports browsing, inserting, editing, cloning and deleting collection documents; its query bar filters the documents displayed. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/documents.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d7b5a74b117e4e92d4036ec0874b7170e5e526d4dc98390c4b8c47834e8347b0",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:3fc1d0b00301a110e9feed8691438714d4919c3e9bf6d10dbe34a395cbd9ff33"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Documents can be viewed as List, JSON or Table; insertion is available through Add Data > Insert Document, with JSON and field-by-field editors. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://blogs.bmc.com/mongodb-compass/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:43f6ab60b93dd13fbb3c137ae02dc6849dd7223a1a4b8c4cd63a4e7c4eab553c",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:2d9956c41f394c6c593bb7d4125a1a5f3f2fa51ca42dcc6864d2a8bdc9de19c0",
            "ev:9dc6134b1c0c2a1b07a53ebd753b0efc829b47f4c8507fab137dc7d2fbc9abf8",
            "ev:ee7381b73b649038fe479ffbd139366607aac1e76d7c648c7aeb431a7f15db30"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The JSON insertion editor accepts an array of documents for inserting several records at once. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.red-gate.com/simple-talk/featured/working-with-documents-in-the-mongodb-compass-gui/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:9afdc5c84218683ed77622927d3f5e2982a65cd2ec15440bb4437bf403117a28",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:561501f2a194ec8ecb87a45184ac32df38f1faae2411fea8ab385d83257f6d6b"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Clone Document opens a new insertion dialog populated from an existing document, so users can adapt its fields and values before inserting a separate record. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://blogs.bmc.com/mongodb-compass/",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:63612b563526abbcc108a0f4e34fac223030950ad966bfb423b2eda1bd2a7bfa",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:17c23f3cf6681f2b738ef875588c64e14e06f16d517bd359c6e2f247d4330f76",
            "ev:e7dc64f4c62aec7b24254b204e753adab3906cc518de6038b8065428803436fe"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "List and Table editing use findOneAndUpdate to update changed fields; JSON editing uses findOneAndReplace to replace the document. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/documents/modify.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:eb1ef8952d952d00f120aa6c64242cd72ab9af0be3d9abac930ead281eac0de2",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:062133e003263d80cf7c5dc8e38f9abb07c52cec5fee4a2647dadb2a85d4b683"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulk update uses the Documents query filter and accepts updateMany update syntax. Its modal does not accept options such as upsert, writeConcern or collation, and document previews require a database configured to support transactions. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/documents/modify-multiple.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:aa6bb9b235b075390fdcc01357f533aa0407d27591b3cf6ea75c7790c7ca5de1",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:a080d902329d61e60baba46a7c81c1141a2209bc7f64afb43c87540a7d81602f"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulk deletion applies the query filter, previews matching documents and requires confirmation. Leaving the query bar blank targets all documents in the collection; deletion is permanent. (high confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/documents/delete-multiple.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d1789c0023689004ef0e970d6204824ecfa8b15fc0794009d4832deafe609300",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:582529d940fc1f7f08272fb15a4b530719c2adb8850ae602b58c8c4016760820"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The readOnly setting hides write UI controls but does not remove the connected user’s shell privileges. Enforce read-only access with the database read role. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/compass/editions.md",
