          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "COMPASS-5528 reported that editing a field inside an array of subdocuments replaced the whole array in Compass 1.30.1. The ticket records the bug as fixed in 1.32.4; it is historical evidence, not evidence that current versions still behave this way. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/COMPASS-5528",
